From 08bfc6f6251928d206e2f0bcb0ea387e4d3e9405 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noamblitz <noamblitz@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2026 12:39:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Project default output to declared fields

apply_json_mango_query now accepts allowed_fields; when the pipeline
has no $project, the default queryset.values() call restricts to those
fields instead of returning every concrete column on the model. Keeps
non-serializable columns (e.g. GeoDjango PointField) out of the JSON
renderer when the caller hasn't projected explicitly.

_QueryExecutor passes ModelQueryToolset.fields minus get_excluded_fields().
Behaviour is unchanged when `fields` is not declared on the toolset.
---
